### Describe the bug

Updating from version `9.0.0-preview.7.24372.9` to `9.0.0-preview.7.24373.9` of `Microsoft.AspNetCore.OpenApi`, `[ProducesResponseType]` seems to have stopped working and instead of the correct response type for an API endpoint, `IResult` is returned instead.

